DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down?   ** Select Screenings 
 in 35mm! **Thursday\, July 9 at 7:30pmSaturday\, July 11 at 4:35pm & 7:30p
 mSunday\, July 12 at 1:35pm & 4:35pm Wednesday\, July 15 at 4:00pm & 7:00p
 m\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-invite\n\nEstimated start
 : 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
