BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Lives of Others (35mm) (2006)
DTSTART:20260723T020000Z
DTEND:20260723T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20260723T020000Z
UID:NNAKEpQ6dJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 137 mins (2h17m)\n\nIn 1983 East Berlin\, a dedicate
 d Stasi officer\, doubting that a famous playwright and his actress-lover 
 are loyal to the Communist Party\, receives approval to spy on them\, beco
 ming unexpectedly sympathetic to the couple until he is ordered to take it
  a step farther.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cold-war-summ
 er/the-lives-of-others\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
